# PAL language menu (README "Languages"). The US code's misc panel (the title
# menu's fourth entry) has only Subtitles; the PAL one lists the five
# languages under it. The panel table, the row count and the selection
# handler are the PAL ones (SFA-Decomp 55.c, VERSION_GSAP01). Text ids
# 0x352-0x356 are the language names in the PAL disc's title text (dir 21).
# The PAL rows end with the dino language cheat row, which the PAL game
# always hides (its On/Off item window is placed for the US layout); the
# cheat itself still works.
1i\
void gameTextSetLanguage(int language);
/^u16 gOptionsMiscPanelEntries\[90\] = {$/,/};$/c\
/* save language index (row - 1) -> gametext language: English, French,\
   Italian, Spanish, German */\
u8 gOptionsLanguageIds[5] = {0, 1, 3, 5, 2};\
\
